* CABSRT11 - BILL DETAIL SORT FOR THE JURISDICTIONAL SUMMARY
* SORTS THE VARIABLE LENGTH BILL DETAIL BY OCN / STATE /
* JURISDICTION SO THAT CABRPT02 CAN BE RUN WITHOUT ITS INTERNAL
* MATRIX WHEN THE MATRIX OVERFLOWS.  THE REPORT PROGRAM DOES NOT
* KNOW WHICH MODE IT IS IN - IT SEARCHES THE MATRIX EITHER WAY.
*
* E15 EXIT CABSXJUR RE-DERIVES THE JURISDICTION BYTE FROM THE
* STATE AND LATA WHEN IT IS BLANK ON THE RECORD.  THE EXIT IS
* WRITTEN IN ASSEMBLER AND LIVES IN TELCABS.CABS.SORTEXIT.
 SORT FIELDS=(26,4,CH,A,31,2,CH,A,30,1,CH,A)
 MODS E15=(CABSXJUR,2048,SORTEXIT,N)
 OPTION EQUALS,VLSHRT
 RECORD TYPE=V,LENGTH=(1651,,,108,1651)
